  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNDP Component B: Consultancy services for rural infrastructure development - Community empowerment, Phase II (Project), an integral part of the Islamic Development Bank&#x2019;s (IsDB) Integrated Rural Development (IRD) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNDP&#x2019;s Phase II project focuses on rural infrastructure and community empowerment in Uzbekistan, part of the IsDB&#x2019;s Integrated Rural Development initiative. It aims to improve living standards, build capacity, and boost prosperity for approximately 500,000 rural residents. Key targets include enhancing infrastructure quality, expanding economic opportunities, and providing training for 3,600 individuals in modern agriculture and governance. The project specifically addresses high-poverty are</narrative>
  </description>
